Recipe regression test for the discriminated-union null-safety pattern
documented in typescript-known-limitations §1.7. Demonstrates that a
defensive consumer that guards on `_present` before dereferencing
`value` verifies cleanly, even when the value field is reference-typed
(string in this case).
